## OMP

- Prefer OMP-native subagents over launching other CLIs from inside OMP. `agent()` takes a full selector with an effort suffix, like `openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:medium`.
- Give every subagent a task that needs at least one tool call. Reply-only prompts can fail on `openai-codex` lanes and look like a lane failure.
